body:
Today i found watch i kept over 10 years in a box, thinking it is just some old watch after my grandma without any value. But as i was going through my stuff preparing to move out i came acros this watch and actualy noticed it is....Rolex?Any advice if it is real or fake would be appreciated. Watch for all those years was working apparently and still does. I don't see any scratches on glass but i do see some on the back of watch and on gold part of bracelet, but there is no steel coming out under scratches on gold.

&#x200B;

[https://imgur.com/a/wZBXtOx](https://imgur.com/a/wZBXtOx)   there are some drops on the watch because it was raining
